  "name": "Jallarzi's Storm of Radiance",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A storm fills a 10-ft-radius, 40-ft-high cylinder while you concentrate. Creatures inside are Blinded and Deafened and can't cast spells with a Verbal component. Creatures in it when it appears, and any that enter it or end a turn there, make a CON save: 2d10 Radiant and 2d10 Thunder, half on a success, once per turn. Both +1d10 per slot level above 5th.</p>",
